WEBVTT

01:32.926 --> 01:36.596
An unidentified body has been found
at 71-1 Sunghan-dong, Jongno-gu.

01:36.679 --> 01:39.682
I repeat, unidentified body found.
Officers needed.

01:39.766 --> 01:41.351
Unit One is en route.

02:00.286 --> 02:05.375
This number is not available.
Please check the number again…

02:06.543 --> 02:07.961
I don't see it.

02:10.004 --> 02:12.048
Where's your ticket to Hawaii?

02:13.967 --> 02:16.553
Right here. I put it here myself.

02:16.636 --> 02:17.470
Hold on.

02:19.389 --> 02:21.349
This number is not…

02:21.432 --> 02:22.767
Goddamn it!

02:27.522 --> 02:28.648
CHOI HYE-JEONG

02:30.233 --> 02:31.067
What?

02:31.151 --> 02:33.486
I just got a call
from Son Myeong-o's aunt.

02:34.445 --> 02:35.530
He died, apparently.

02:36.114 --> 02:37.782
His body was found last night.

02:39.534 --> 02:42.245
You sure have a large social circle.

02:42.745 --> 02:44.831
You keep in touch with his aunt?

02:44.914 --> 02:46.749
Well, I keep in touch with you too.

02:46.833 --> 02:47.667
Hey.

02:47.750 --> 02:51.462
What you said was true, you know.
Friendship alone can't keep us going.

02:52.839 --> 02:55.008
You don't even know
what I have up my sleeve.

02:55.925 --> 02:56.759
Yeon-jin.

02:57.635 --> 02:59.304
You're so fucked!

03:00.763 --> 03:02.140
Thanks for letting me know.

03:03.308 --> 03:06.227
I seem to have just lost two friends.

03:15.153 --> 03:18.740
You really want me to sell the motel?
But the business is going well.

03:18.823 --> 03:19.657
Sell it.

03:19.741 --> 03:22.327
I don't care if it's dirt cheap,
just sell it.

03:22.410 --> 03:25.413
Find a real estate agent tomorrow
and call me.

03:44.432 --> 03:46.935
Oh, where have you been?

03:47.977 --> 03:48.978
Did you have lunch?

03:49.812 --> 03:51.314
Business was good last night, eh?

03:52.440 --> 03:53.942
We had some instant noodles.

03:54.025 --> 03:56.361
Why do you guys only eat instant noodles?

03:58.029 --> 04:00.323
Have some jjigae instead. Yeah.

04:00.406 --> 04:01.241
Here.

04:02.116 --> 04:03.201
Boss, you're the best.

04:04.911 --> 04:06.412
Still working for Yeon-jin?

04:06.955 --> 04:08.790
Yes, I make some extra cash from it.

04:08.873 --> 04:11.209
All right. Then have a good one.

04:11.292 --> 04:13.002
Don't forget. No minors.

04:13.086 --> 04:14.504
Yes, sir. Drive safe.

04:14.587 --> 04:15.421
Sure.

05:15.815 --> 05:17.567
How often do you drink?

05:18.234 --> 05:20.570
What are you talking about?

05:21.321 --> 05:24.741
I've never had a drop of alcohol
in my entire life.

05:26.951 --> 05:28.286
Just ask my daughter.

05:28.369 --> 05:33.041
My daughter's a teacher. A teacher!

05:33.583 --> 05:36.586
You were diagnosed
with alcohol dependency six years ago.

05:36.669 --> 05:38.671
Are you saying you haven't
had a drink since then?

05:38.755 --> 05:41.341
Um, about that…

05:42.633 --> 05:43.968
Right, just one glass.

05:44.594 --> 05:46.095
The glass was only half full.

05:46.179 --> 05:48.014
And I didn't even drink it all at once.

05:49.015 --> 05:51.100
How much do you drink
once you start drinking?

05:51.184 --> 05:52.310
How many bottles?

05:52.393 --> 05:55.563
I said I don't drink!

05:55.646 --> 05:57.357
How dare you, you quack!

05:59.817 --> 06:02.820
I see why you brought me here.

06:02.904 --> 06:04.739
You fucking bitch!

06:05.406 --> 06:07.825
You two are ganging up on me, aren't you?

06:07.909 --> 06:11.746
-Why did you start the fire?
-What fire?

06:11.829 --> 06:14.832
It was just a small burn on the floor!

06:14.916 --> 06:19.337
I was just trying
to talk some sense into her.

06:19.420 --> 06:22.673
You know, there's a fire extinguisher
in every house these days.

06:22.757 --> 06:24.592
We put out the fire quickly. Quickly.

06:25.885 --> 06:29.639
What a convenient world we live in!

06:30.723 --> 06:33.226
I think we're done here. You may leave.

06:33.309 --> 06:34.477
I can leave?

06:36.020 --> 06:36.854
Really?

06:42.402 --> 06:45.071
CONSENT FORM FOR ADMISSION
PATIENT: JEONG MI-HEE

06:45.154 --> 06:46.739
FAMILY RELATION CERTIFICATE

06:46.823 --> 06:48.282
The documents are now confirmed.

06:52.578 --> 06:53.496
This way.

06:53.579 --> 06:55.081
Let go!

06:56.416 --> 06:58.084
You bastards! Let go!

06:59.085 --> 07:01.921
Dong-eun! These people are taking me away!

07:02.672 --> 07:04.674
Say something. Come on!

07:12.265 --> 07:14.892
I'm the only one
who can do this to you, Mom.

07:16.602 --> 07:19.439
Because I am

07:20.690 --> 07:22.191
your only blood.

07:31.617 --> 07:33.286
I won't be able to visit often.

07:35.580 --> 07:37.123
You bitch!

07:37.623 --> 07:40.209
How could you? I'm your mother.

07:40.710 --> 07:42.962
You fucking snake!

07:43.713 --> 07:46.632
Hey! Let go, you assholes!

07:48.301 --> 07:51.971
I'll go with this for the flooring.
As for the wallpaper, let's see…

07:53.097 --> 07:55.850
What's going on between you and Ms. Moon?

07:55.933 --> 07:58.603
You startled me. Hello.

07:58.686 --> 08:00.271
I didn't sneak up on you.

08:01.189 --> 08:02.440
Are you done picking?

08:02.523 --> 08:03.441
No, not yet.

08:04.275 --> 08:07.695
I'm debating whether I should go
with mid-century modern white

08:07.778 --> 08:10.114
or Bauhaus gray.

08:10.198 --> 08:11.699
Oh, I'm so torn.

08:12.783 --> 08:14.619
What a nice way to treat a rental home.

08:14.702 --> 08:17.330
Get him whichever one's more expensive.

08:17.830 --> 08:18.915
Sure, okay!

08:18.998 --> 08:21.083
Did your new tenant already vacate?

08:21.167 --> 08:23.669
No, the house caught fire.

08:23.753 --> 08:26.172
Oh, I heard about the fire yesterday.
That was yours?

08:26.255 --> 08:29.592
Oh no, how did that happen?
Are they paying for the damages?

08:29.675 --> 08:32.678
No, none of that. I didn't say anything.

08:33.179 --> 08:37.016
The tenant who lives there saved my life.

08:37.099 --> 08:39.101
What? Really?

08:43.189 --> 08:44.106
Is that her?

08:44.190 --> 08:47.818
Was your father involved in tax evasion
through your art exhibitions?

08:47.902 --> 08:51.155
Some say he used his followers' names
to buy paintings to evade gift tax.

08:51.239 --> 08:52.865
Do you regret doing drugs?

08:54.033 --> 08:55.535
Ms. Lee, give us a comment!

09:02.375 --> 09:04.710
Drink up. Tomatoes are good for detox.

09:07.129 --> 09:08.965
What happened to that Yeon-jin bitch?

09:09.048 --> 09:11.551
Is that the first thing
you're going to say to your mom?

09:12.134 --> 09:14.679
I lost weight from being so anxious.
Can't you see?

09:15.179 --> 09:17.098
When do I have to show up at the station?

09:17.181 --> 09:19.850
They'll let you know some time next week.

09:19.934 --> 09:21.936
If you cooperate with the investigation,

09:22.019 --> 09:25.106
it will help reduce your sentence,
so it's better if you show up.

09:25.189 --> 09:26.941
Ugh, so annoying! Shit!

09:27.608 --> 09:29.360
Have you looked for my phone?

09:29.443 --> 09:32.280
That old thing? It was in your old room.

09:33.114 --> 09:33.990
Why do you need it?

09:35.074 --> 09:36.826
It contains a precious memory.

09:37.743 --> 09:39.996
Some bitch's face.

09:48.170 --> 09:49.338
Let's go there.

09:49.422 --> 09:50.798
-Where?
-Their food was good.

09:50.881 --> 09:53.217
You mean there? Sure, okay.

09:53.301 --> 09:55.136
Oh, I'm so hungry.

10:00.850 --> 10:03.519
Oh, shoot!
You're wearing matching clothes!

10:04.020 --> 10:06.689
Poor you, Yeon-jin.
You must be so embarrassed.

10:06.772 --> 10:09.775
Wow, this means
you two are practically besties.

10:09.859 --> 10:11.277
A moment worth capturing.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.820
Shut up, both of you.

10:13.321 --> 10:15.072
Hey. You!

10:21.495 --> 10:22.496
Take it off.

10:23.581 --> 10:25.750
-What?
-Are you deaf like your mom?

10:25.833 --> 10:28.419
Strip and stop freaking
talking back to me!

10:30.880 --> 10:31.964
She's shit-scared.

10:35.718 --> 10:37.053
I'm sorry, Yeon-jin.

10:38.304 --> 10:39.805
These aren't real.

10:40.890 --> 10:42.058
They are fake.

10:42.933 --> 10:44.644
-She said fake!
-I'm so sorry.

10:45.144 --> 10:46.395
Hey, she bolted!

10:46.479 --> 10:48.064
Yeon-jin is so pissed.

10:48.564 --> 10:50.066
I'm going to kill that bitch.

10:50.149 --> 10:51.817
Look at how pissed she is!

10:52.318 --> 10:53.486
Fuck, put that away!

10:53.569 --> 10:55.988
MY DAUGHTER WAS A VICTIM
OF SCHOOL VIOLENCE

11:01.702 --> 11:04.330
BULLIED HER BY BURNING HER
WITH CURLING IRON AND CIGARETTES

11:04.413 --> 11:07.833
"A" WORKS AT A BROADCASTING STATION
AS A WEATHER FORECASTER

11:24.600 --> 11:27.103
There was this sentence
in the online posting.

11:28.020 --> 11:29.355
"My daughter had left home

11:30.272 --> 11:33.484
to go to an academy, but fell
from a derelict building and died."

11:36.195 --> 11:37.446
Do you think it's true?

11:38.698 --> 11:42.034
It depends on which path you want to take.

11:42.660 --> 11:45.162
The path that leads to the truth
or the opposite.

11:49.375 --> 11:51.127
Why did you quit your job at the school?

11:51.627 --> 11:53.629
Was that because of Yeon-jin as well?

11:55.131 --> 11:56.215
Not entirely.

11:56.966 --> 12:00.636
I'd never be able to become
a good teacher anyway.

12:08.269 --> 12:10.146
This is the address you asked for.

12:10.229 --> 12:12.189
Only one family member lives there.

12:12.815 --> 12:13.816
It's her mother.

12:15.151 --> 12:17.737
And the name of the deceased
is Yoon So-hee.

12:21.115 --> 12:22.241
It's my understanding…

12:23.743 --> 12:25.161
that she's still in a mortuary.

12:26.996 --> 12:28.414
Which hospital is it?

12:29.832 --> 12:31.167
Do you intend to move her?

12:31.917 --> 12:32.752
Or

12:33.753 --> 12:34.795
are you trying to help?

12:38.674 --> 12:40.259
Seoul Joo General Hospital.

12:42.386 --> 12:43.220
Here.

12:43.971 --> 12:46.390
It's what you asked me
to dig into the other day.

12:46.474 --> 12:47.933
The details are inside.

12:47.975 --> 12:49.185
JOO YEO-JEONG

12:49.268 --> 12:52.521
By the way, his family owns
Seoul Joo General Hospital.

12:55.608 --> 12:57.276
-Is that right?
-Yes.

13:02.990 --> 13:04.909
10TH ANNIVERSARY,
FAMILY OF DOCTORS BECOME PARTNERS

13:09.038 --> 13:11.040
Why did you protect Ye-sol?

13:12.875 --> 13:16.629
Using her would have been
the fastest way to torment Yeon-jin.

13:18.631 --> 13:22.134
If I had, it would have pained you too.

13:27.890 --> 13:30.142
Once this revenge is over, will you…

13:32.311 --> 13:33.562
find happiness?

13:40.694 --> 13:42.196
I hope so.

13:45.282 --> 13:47.201
I wish to be happy enough…

13:49.245 --> 13:50.412
that I could die.

13:52.081 --> 13:54.083
I want to be happy, just by that much.

14:03.968 --> 14:05.886
What a rude motherfucker.

14:05.970 --> 14:08.806
HA DO YEO NG
LET'S MEET UP

14:09.390 --> 14:11.809
I said, let's meet. It's important.

14:17.523 --> 14:19.525
You got Hye-jeong's call, right?

14:21.694 --> 14:22.695
Son Myeong-o.

14:24.363 --> 14:25.447
I heard he died.

14:28.784 --> 14:30.619
You must know since you live together.

14:33.622 --> 14:34.540
I heard.

14:38.794 --> 14:42.047
I figured you'd be the first to know
apart from his family.

14:42.548 --> 14:43.966
He worked here, after all.

14:45.801 --> 14:47.303
What did the police say?

14:49.138 --> 14:52.892
Did you hear anything
about the cause of death or whatever?

14:54.226 --> 14:55.102
I did.

14:58.397 --> 15:01.066
They told me where Son Myeong-o was found.

15:02.234 --> 15:03.485
Where was he found?

15:04.320 --> 15:05.571
That abandoned building

15:06.322 --> 15:07.197
where So-hee fell.

15:13.329 --> 15:15.581
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry, Yeon-jin.

15:15.664 --> 15:17.791
I threw away those clothes. I really did.

15:22.254 --> 15:23.422
Fine.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.007
Really?

15:25.841 --> 15:27.593
Thank you so much, Yeon-jin.

15:29.511 --> 15:32.681
That's a given. What else?

15:39.063 --> 15:40.981
I'll stay out of your sight and…

15:42.483 --> 15:45.235
That's also a given. What else?

15:46.737 --> 15:49.448
I knew it. You're not really sorry.

15:49.531 --> 15:53.118
That's not it.
I'm really sorry, Yeon-jin. I really am.

15:53.202 --> 15:54.036
Is that right?

15:55.454 --> 15:57.289
Then strip. It's not too late.

16:00.417 --> 16:01.418
But here's the thing.

16:02.753 --> 16:06.757
I recently bought
a really expensive ASMR file.

16:08.509 --> 16:10.594
You're the one
who saw him last, aren't you?

16:11.095 --> 16:11.929
At Siesta.

16:16.308 --> 16:18.560
That bastard actually
recorded me that day?

16:21.730 --> 16:24.149
Oh, that must be it.

16:24.942 --> 16:26.527
That's what Hye-jeong has on me.

16:29.029 --> 16:29.947
So, what's in it?

16:31.448 --> 16:32.783
Something shocking.

16:35.619 --> 16:38.122
Fuck, Yeon-jin!

16:38.205 --> 16:39.915
So, what are you going to do?

16:40.874 --> 16:44.044
I'm Ye-sol's mother.
I'm the mother of your daughter.

16:44.586 --> 16:46.422
You know it all now. What will you do?

16:49.049 --> 16:50.634
You have to save me.

16:51.135 --> 16:53.220
You have to save me and Ye-sol.

16:53.303 --> 16:55.597
You're our only hope now, Jae-jun.

16:57.433 --> 16:58.851
Give it to me straight.

17:00.352 --> 17:01.687
What did you do to Myeong-o?

17:03.522 --> 17:04.690
It was an accident.

17:05.607 --> 17:08.277
I took care of it.
I don't understand how it got to this.

17:08.360 --> 17:11.363
This was definitely Moon Dong-eun's doing.

17:12.114 --> 17:15.034
A doctor is helping her.
His family owns Seoul Joo Hospital!

17:15.117 --> 17:17.870
And that's where her body is!

17:18.704 --> 17:19.621
Joo Hospital?

17:19.705 --> 17:21.790
I'm in such a mess right now.

17:22.458 --> 17:23.959
I'll bring Ye-sol with me.

17:24.043 --> 17:26.211
I'll bring her and come to you, okay?

17:26.295 --> 17:28.964
We can't let her become
a murderer's daughter, can we?

17:29.506 --> 17:30.340
So…

17:32.551 --> 17:34.720
I was with you that day.

17:35.387 --> 17:36.388
Right?

17:41.310 --> 17:42.311
I see.

17:45.105 --> 17:47.274
We must have been very naughty
that day too.

17:48.650 --> 17:49.485
Right?

18:12.758 --> 18:13.592
Ji-hyeon.

18:14.676 --> 18:16.095
-Where's Ye-sol?
-Well…

18:16.178 --> 18:18.180
Your friend's here.

18:19.306 --> 18:22.267
Wow, your drawing is so good, Ye-sol.

18:22.351 --> 18:24.061
Do you want to work as my apprentice?

18:26.021 --> 18:29.024
Do you like to get high, Ye-sol?

18:32.945 --> 18:33.779
Come with me.

18:34.404 --> 18:36.490
Oh! What's with the fuss?

18:36.573 --> 18:37.908
I meant "get hired."

18:37.991 --> 18:40.327
Ye-sol, let's make that a promise, okay?

18:40.410 --> 18:41.328
Bye!

18:45.290 --> 18:46.291
You psychotic bitch!

18:46.375 --> 18:48.043
Wow, fuck.

18:48.127 --> 18:50.129
You almost seemed like a good mother.

18:50.212 --> 18:53.090
You must have spent a fortune on lawyers.
You're out already?

18:53.173 --> 18:55.259
See? I knew it was you, bitch.

18:55.342 --> 18:58.679
I'm just looking out for you.
You should be more careful.

18:59.429 --> 19:01.348
-You're not a first offender anymore.
-See?

19:01.849 --> 19:02.933
I knew it was you.

19:03.976 --> 19:06.478
The asshole who wrote about my exhibition.

19:06.562 --> 19:08.480
It's the same guy who sucked up to you.

19:08.981 --> 19:11.733
Reporter Kang Hyeong-jin of Doowon Daily.

19:11.817 --> 19:13.152
What the hell are you saying?

19:13.652 --> 19:14.987
You're being ridiculous.

19:15.070 --> 19:16.488
Don't you think it's ridiculous

19:16.572 --> 19:19.825
that a citizen on drugs got streamed live
on the day you got exposed?

19:20.659 --> 19:22.744
You exposed me so you can bury your news.

19:23.537 --> 19:26.039
You blabbed about the tax evasion,
didn't you?

19:33.964 --> 19:35.257
Thanks for letting me know.

19:35.757 --> 19:38.343
I seem to have just lost two friends.

19:52.524 --> 19:56.570
I'm telling the truth. It was here.
Why would I come here just to lie to you?

19:56.653 --> 19:58.030
Save it!

19:58.822 --> 20:00.741
You're going to handle it, right?

20:03.869 --> 20:04.703
Hey.

20:05.996 --> 20:08.165
What are you looking at? Fuck, what is it?

20:08.248 --> 20:09.750
What are you looking at?

20:10.626 --> 20:13.629
I'm not going down by myself,
you fucking bitch!

20:23.388 --> 20:25.682
NEW MESSAGE
DONG! EUN!

20:25.766 --> 20:26.725
Where are you?

20:29.061 --> 20:31.396
I came to see you. Where are you?

20:35.025 --> 20:35.943
Far away.

20:38.237 --> 20:39.238
How far away are you?

20:42.532 --> 20:43.367
Want a ride?

20:58.799 --> 21:01.802
You got the wrong person.
I have a crush on someone else.

21:09.476 --> 21:11.478
I still have two kilometers left to run.

21:11.979 --> 21:14.231
We said hello, so you can go on.
I'll run home.

21:19.528 --> 21:22.531
Do you jog like this often?
You take good care of your body.

21:22.614 --> 21:24.825
I said, I have a crush on someone else.

21:24.908 --> 21:26.410
Is it because you're a doctor?

21:26.493 --> 21:28.453
Stamina is what determines the winner.

21:28.537 --> 21:30.038
Who are you up against?

21:30.122 --> 21:33.875
I said, you got the wrong guy.
I really have a crush on someone else.

21:33.959 --> 21:34.876
She's very pretty.

21:35.836 --> 21:37.671
I'll leave if you don't hop in.

21:37.754 --> 21:39.506
I know you're not going to leave.

21:39.589 --> 21:40.632
You say you will, but…

21:42.884 --> 21:44.720
Hey, Dong-eun?

21:44.803 --> 21:45.721
Wait up!

21:46.805 --> 21:49.725
Plate number 4225! Moon Dong-eun!

21:56.231 --> 21:57.065
God.

22:12.539 --> 22:15.375
That came out of nowhere.
Why are you hugging me?

22:18.211 --> 22:19.212
Because I missed you.

22:21.465 --> 22:22.799
We just saw each other.

22:25.344 --> 22:26.928
But that was so long ago.

22:30.724 --> 22:33.643
What's the use of me being on guard
if you run at me like this?

22:33.727 --> 22:35.604
Why are you on guard around me?

22:36.104 --> 22:38.357
Because you're a kindhearted lunatic.

22:41.860 --> 22:42.861
Oh, right.

22:42.944 --> 22:45.947
Your landlord at Eden Apartments.
Did you know her before?

22:46.740 --> 22:48.408
-Did I know her?
-Yeah.

22:48.992 --> 22:51.495
She said you saved her life.

22:53.580 --> 22:54.998
I don't think so.

22:55.082 --> 22:58.335
I never had the time to save anyone,
nor did I lead a life of virtue.

22:59.211 --> 23:01.963
Well, I can see that.
It's strange, isn't it?

23:02.964 --> 23:06.051
-I take back the "kindhearted" part.
-Jeez, you're so strict.

23:07.803 --> 23:10.305
See you later, then.
I still have a kilometer left.

23:22.818 --> 23:24.236
You're saying,

23:24.319 --> 23:27.030
a missing person turned up dead and--

23:27.114 --> 23:30.700
Is it a yes or a no?
Will they do an autopsy or not?

23:32.577 --> 23:35.747
Without proof of suicide or accident,
an autopsy is a must.

23:36.331 --> 23:37.749
Even if the family says no?

23:38.750 --> 23:40.419
Even if three generations oppose it?

23:40.502 --> 23:41.336
Even if.

23:42.003 --> 23:45.507
If the police suspect foul play,
they can force the autopsy with a warrant.

23:46.007 --> 23:47.676
Then there's no doubt they'll do it.

23:49.136 --> 23:50.303
So I can't stop this.

23:52.264 --> 23:53.265
You're scaring me.

23:53.348 --> 23:56.643
You used to ask about tax evasion.
Why the new interest in criminal law?

23:57.727 --> 23:59.563
Okay, I'm cutting off the mother.

24:01.148 --> 24:02.232
Bye. I have a meeting.

24:02.315 --> 24:03.900
Hey, where are you going?

24:03.984 --> 24:05.944
Why are you cutting your mother off?

24:08.613 --> 24:10.282
Sit down, it's a long story.

24:11.616 --> 24:12.451
Want a sip?

24:12.534 --> 24:14.453
I'd prefer it if you'd get to the point.

24:14.536 --> 24:16.705
You'd rather get the beating
over with, huh?

24:18.290 --> 24:20.125
I guess you never got beaten before.

24:21.042 --> 24:22.377
Well, I can relate.

24:22.461 --> 24:26.047
It was my first beating the other day too.
So I didn't know how to fight back.

24:26.131 --> 24:27.132
I said,

24:27.716 --> 24:29.134
get to the point.

24:29.217 --> 24:31.303
I almost cussed when you interrupted me.

24:32.471 --> 24:33.638
Suit yourself, then.

24:34.681 --> 24:35.515
You already know

24:35.599 --> 24:38.059
that this place is special
to Yeon-jin, don't you?

24:38.143 --> 24:39.978
Don't cross the line.

24:46.234 --> 24:47.569
October 19th.

24:47.652 --> 24:49.654
It's a recording on Son Myeong-o's phone.

24:50.155 --> 24:51.573
Take it and give it a listen.

24:52.240 --> 24:55.243
You know who Son Myeong-o is.
You used to look for him too.

24:56.411 --> 24:58.330
That prick was last spotted here,

24:58.413 --> 25:00.415
and the last person
to see him was Yeon-jin.

25:01.583 --> 25:03.001
That's what I meant earlier.

25:05.086 --> 25:07.506
Right. Here's something more important.

25:08.507 --> 25:11.176
I only cottoned on to this today,

25:12.677 --> 25:14.012
but there used to be

25:15.514 --> 25:19.935
an expensive bottle of liquor
that had a good grip to it.

25:20.810 --> 25:23.230
But I see now that the bottle is missing.

25:24.773 --> 25:27.275
Do you mind asking Yeon-jin where it is?

25:29.736 --> 25:33.240
Please say to her,
"What an expensive murder, Yeon-jin."

25:44.042 --> 25:46.211
-So you're saying--
-Yes, exactly.

25:48.588 --> 25:50.173
Yeon-jin's a murderer.

25:55.554 --> 25:57.055
Cut the crap.

25:57.556 --> 25:58.723
What do you want, then?

25:59.891 --> 26:01.226
For me to report her?

26:01.309 --> 26:02.477
Wow, you're nuts.

26:03.144 --> 26:05.313
If I wanted that,
I would've done it myself.

26:05.814 --> 26:07.315
I want you to be my accomplice.

26:08.441 --> 26:10.527
I won't hand this over to the police.

26:11.194 --> 26:13.280
Divorce her
and give up your parental rights.

26:13.363 --> 26:14.614
That's all I need.

26:16.825 --> 26:19.995
We don't want the kid's mother
to become a murderer, do we?

26:20.787 --> 26:22.372
Be it Jeon Ye-sol or Ha Ye-sol.

26:26.751 --> 26:27.586
Are you…

26:29.796 --> 26:31.548
using Ye-sol to threaten me?

26:34.384 --> 26:35.885
A long time ago…

26:37.721 --> 26:39.889
I gave Yeon-jin an alibi.

26:41.182 --> 26:43.602
Apparently, a girl she was with
on a rooftop had died.

26:45.645 --> 26:46.646
But guess what?

26:48.857 --> 26:51.359
Someone she was with
on October 19th died, again.

26:56.364 --> 26:57.532
What should we do now?

26:59.242 --> 27:00.910
Are you going to do it this time?

27:01.911 --> 27:03.121
Give Yeon-jin her alibi?

27:20.138 --> 27:21.306
Honey!

27:21.389 --> 27:23.558
What on earth is going on?

27:24.225 --> 27:25.685
Get in. You must hurry.

27:28.938 --> 27:31.941
Go to Ji-min's. I'll be right there.
Call me when you arrive.

27:42.952 --> 27:45.205
HONG YEONG-AE

27:46.456 --> 27:48.291
-Yeah.
-Let's meet up today.

27:48.792 --> 27:50.627
After all, we go back 40 years.

27:51.211 --> 27:53.546
We should at least end things in person.

27:53.630 --> 27:54.547
What time?

28:04.057 --> 28:06.059
PARK YEON-JIN

28:31.042 --> 28:31.876
Hello?

28:32.377 --> 28:34.629
I'm working for the lady
from Pyeongchang-dong.

28:34.713 --> 28:37.132
I'm texting you the address.
See you there.

28:42.887 --> 28:44.723
I can't believe this is happening!

28:46.474 --> 28:49.060
Dinner's almost ready.
I'm just waiting for this to boil.

28:49.144 --> 28:51.479
God, shut up about cheonggukjang!

28:51.563 --> 28:52.814
Aren't you sick of it?

28:52.897 --> 28:55.817
You can have the goddamn stuff
by yourself!

28:56.317 --> 28:57.444
Oh, and…

28:58.987 --> 29:00.655
I might be away for a few days.

29:01.156 --> 29:03.616
Don't even think about calling me, okay?

29:20.258 --> 29:22.761
Where are you? Across the street?

29:22.844 --> 29:26.598
Walk up that way a bit
and cross the street.

29:26.681 --> 29:29.309
-The bag is heavy, so please hurry!
-Up?

29:30.185 --> 29:32.520
Yeah, okay. I'll be there in a second!

29:38.610 --> 29:41.196
Where are we going?
You should at least tell me.

29:41.279 --> 29:42.280
We're here.

29:42.864 --> 29:43.740
Where are we?

29:43.823 --> 29:45.575
Things used to be simple with you.

29:46.075 --> 29:47.494
You only worked for money.

29:47.577 --> 29:49.579
But I guess I'm the end of all that.

29:51.581 --> 29:52.749
What are you on about?

29:52.832 --> 29:55.168
You only get probation
for manslaughter, right?

29:55.251 --> 29:57.962
And the odds are in your favor
if there's an eyewitness.

30:16.856 --> 30:18.233
Are you out of your mind?

30:23.112 --> 30:24.030
Shit!

30:42.298 --> 30:43.299
Is he dead?

30:45.009 --> 30:45.844
He's dead, right?

30:45.927 --> 30:47.345
Fuck!

30:51.140 --> 30:53.393
Hey, this asshole is…

30:54.602 --> 30:55.436
Did you--

30:55.520 --> 30:56.771
There's been an accident.

30:56.855 --> 30:59.524
I hit a jaywalker. Please hurry!

30:59.607 --> 31:00.525
Fuck.

31:02.527 --> 31:04.529
Are you mad?
You shouldn't have called it in.

31:04.612 --> 31:07.574
I wasn't drunk.
I was driving under the speed limit.

31:07.657 --> 31:09.868
I couldn't see properly
because of the rain.

31:11.327 --> 31:13.830
Handle it. You're an eyewitness now.

31:15.582 --> 31:16.416
What?

31:17.000 --> 31:19.002
You think I'm a bloody idiot, don't you?

31:19.085 --> 31:22.005
Did you think I wouldn't find out
that you two were a team?

31:22.088 --> 31:24.591
What the hell are you talking about?
We're not a team!

31:24.674 --> 31:26.342
How else would he have known?

31:26.426 --> 31:28.303
Only you know what happened back then.

31:28.386 --> 31:31.306
How in the world would I know?
It wasn't me!

31:31.389 --> 31:33.349
Were you always this fucking crazy?

31:33.433 --> 31:35.268
Don't bullshit me.

31:35.351 --> 31:37.020
You're not getting out of this.

31:37.103 --> 31:39.522
Whether you're in it or not,
you have to handle this.

31:40.398 --> 31:43.234
I haven't destroyed the evidence
that proves we're accomplices.

31:43.818 --> 31:44.861
Yeon-jin's name tag.

31:46.154 --> 31:47.405
God damn it!

31:51.701 --> 31:53.536
You've fucking lost your marbles.

31:54.120 --> 31:56.915
That evidence works against you
more than me, Yeong-ae.

31:57.415 --> 31:59.125
It proves your kid's a murderer!

31:59.208 --> 32:00.627
I'm an ordinary housewife.

32:00.710 --> 32:03.880
How would I be in possession of evidence
that was handed to the cops?

32:03.963 --> 32:05.882
It's still sealed in the way you gave me.

32:06.799 --> 32:09.218
The informant, the dead kid,
Yeon-jin, me, or you!

32:10.845 --> 32:13.598
I bet the evidence has the DNA
of at least one of us.

32:16.434 --> 32:18.186
What a joke!

32:18.269 --> 32:19.354
Fuck!

32:19.854 --> 32:22.523
What the hell are you doing,
you crazy bitch?

32:23.775 --> 32:27.362
I'm just trying to get the best out of you
before you run away. So what?

32:28.112 --> 32:31.866
I'm bringing you down with me
no matter what.

32:32.367 --> 32:33.451
So take care of this.

32:33.952 --> 32:38.122
We're in this together,
so we either live or die together,

32:38.206 --> 32:39.040
Yeong-jun.

32:56.808 --> 32:59.227
Light the candles in the shrine
and bleed a chicken.

32:59.310 --> 33:00.144
I will.

33:00.895 --> 33:03.481
But did you come with her?

33:03.564 --> 33:04.399
Huh?

33:09.779 --> 33:11.531
Oh, you startled me.

33:12.615 --> 33:15.451
We're not open today,
not at this hour anyway.

33:15.535 --> 33:16.619
Off you go.

33:16.703 --> 33:18.871
So, you're only working
your side job today?

33:21.624 --> 33:25.294
You set out very quickly.
Maybe because Yeon-jin's mom was involved?

33:27.463 --> 33:29.298
Vroom, wham!

33:31.759 --> 33:33.761
Who are you?

34:07.045 --> 34:08.212
Wow.

34:08.713 --> 34:11.215
We meet again at such an unexpected place.

34:12.050 --> 34:14.052
Why didn't you turn on the lights?

34:16.137 --> 34:18.139
What brings you here, Mr. Joo?

34:19.265 --> 34:20.600
I find that stranger.

34:21.184 --> 34:24.103
Oh, so you came here
without any prior knowledge.

34:24.729 --> 34:25.813
Twice, at that.

34:27.940 --> 34:29.358
I'm the owner here, you see.

34:32.779 --> 34:33.780
No way.

34:37.617 --> 34:38.951
I was looking for a bathroom…

34:39.827 --> 34:42.330
I'm so startled,
I can't think of a better excuse.

35:03.267 --> 35:04.602
OUT OF BUSINESS
DO NOT ENTER

35:12.527 --> 35:13.736
Open the gate!

35:15.988 --> 35:19.242
I'm trying to keep trespassers out.
Take today, for example.

35:19.992 --> 35:21.744
You're doing this on purpose.

35:28.709 --> 35:30.545
What did you do to me the other day?

35:31.629 --> 35:34.715
What did you do to me
when you put me under that day?

35:35.716 --> 35:36.717
The procedure?

35:37.760 --> 35:40.346
Your jawline looks slim now,
making you look beautiful.

35:42.014 --> 35:44.267
I don't know what that bitch said to you,

35:44.767 --> 35:47.436
but don't meddle
when you don't know the whole story.

35:49.230 --> 35:51.482
You know
I practice dermatology too, right?

35:52.733 --> 35:54.318
I can tell by looking at a scar

35:54.819 --> 35:56.904
what kind of pain
the abuser tried to inflict.

35:59.157 --> 36:00.783
It was the work of the devil.

36:05.997 --> 36:07.748
You were looking for something.

36:09.208 --> 36:10.251
This is it, right?

36:11.002 --> 36:11.919
Take it.

36:12.420 --> 36:14.547
I've already got what I need.

36:16.799 --> 36:18.551
You can open the gate yourself.

36:18.634 --> 36:21.387
The chains are a trick. It's not locked.

36:22.471 --> 36:24.307
And I won't charge you for parking.

36:24.807 --> 36:27.185
I have a feeling
that's your last lucky break.

36:29.020 --> 36:30.188
Drive safe.

36:31.189 --> 36:35.610
On days like this,
there are a lot of jaywalking accidents.

36:55.630 --> 36:59.133
NEW MESSAGE

36:59.217 --> 37:00.051
MOM

37:00.092 --> 37:01.761
I'm at the police station. Pick me up.

37:03.888 --> 37:05.223
The rain was pouring.

37:05.306 --> 37:07.391
And the man jumped out of nowhere.

37:09.518 --> 37:13.272
We tested for DUI at the site,
so we know she was sober.

37:13.773 --> 37:16.734
He was jaywalking.
There was no negligence on her part.

37:17.235 --> 37:19.487
She has no record.
She didn't flee the scene.

37:20.655 --> 37:21.739
That's all there is.

37:22.990 --> 37:25.618
Yes, sir. I'm well aware of what happened.

37:26.118 --> 37:28.120
But there were no cameras at the site.

37:28.996 --> 37:31.332
We're trying to get in touch
with the family,

37:31.415 --> 37:34.585
so please stay put for a minute, ma'am.

37:35.336 --> 37:37.588
As for you, you can go home, Chief.

37:38.256 --> 37:39.840
Okay, good work.

37:41.926 --> 37:43.261
Don't worry too much.

37:44.095 --> 37:47.682
It's important to come to an agreement
with the bereaved. Keep that in mind.

37:48.516 --> 37:49.350
I will.

37:50.559 --> 37:51.978
Thanks, Shin.

37:52.979 --> 37:55.064
Right. I'll keep in touch.

37:56.607 --> 37:57.441
Bye.

37:57.525 --> 37:58.609
Have a safe trip, sir.

37:59.485 --> 38:00.528
It was raining,

38:01.612 --> 38:02.780
and I couldn't see.

38:04.365 --> 38:06.200
I'm so sorry.

38:07.576 --> 38:09.412
I'm so sorry!

38:11.664 --> 38:13.541
You don't have to say sorry to me, ma'am.

38:13.624 --> 38:16.836
-No, I'm so sorry!
-Please try to calm down.

38:16.919 --> 38:19.380
Mr. Son Myeong-o was found dead.

38:19.964 --> 38:21.299
Did you hear?

38:22.425 --> 38:24.510
No. Where was he found?

38:25.344 --> 38:26.762
You don't seem that surprised.

38:27.346 --> 38:29.140
Did you talk to Park Yeon-jin?

38:29.974 --> 38:32.810
Or am I a suspect right now?

38:35.354 --> 38:37.523
We checked Mr. Son's emails.

38:37.606 --> 38:40.192
He was looking into the Yoon So-hee case.

38:40.276 --> 38:42.778
And the person
who gave him the information

38:44.071 --> 38:45.323
was you, Ms. Moon.

38:46.365 --> 38:47.783
Is that illegal?

38:48.284 --> 38:50.911
There are many people
who are far worse than me.

38:51.412 --> 38:52.496
How disappointing.

38:53.914 --> 38:55.166
What exactly is going on?

38:56.250 --> 38:58.252
What exactly happened between you all?

38:59.337 --> 39:01.339
I already told you everything.

39:02.298 --> 39:03.799
Although you didn't believe me.

39:04.884 --> 39:06.302
That was all true?

39:09.513 --> 39:14.352
WINTER OF 2004

39:32.203 --> 39:33.704
Do you smoke, by any chance?

39:34.747 --> 39:36.957
The list of evidence shows

39:37.041 --> 39:39.794
that a lighter was found
at the site where So-hee died.

39:40.628 --> 39:44.215
When you flick a lighter, don't you leave

39:45.341 --> 39:47.176
some sort of DNA trace?

39:57.144 --> 39:57.978
Mom!

39:58.771 --> 40:01.273
Did you bring your car?
Let's go to the shaman.

40:01.357 --> 40:04.193
Why would we go there right now?
What's going on?

40:04.276 --> 40:06.028
I feel safer there.

40:06.112 --> 40:08.447
It's better than going to a psychiatrist.

40:10.449 --> 40:12.451
Do you have the family's phone number?

40:12.535 --> 40:15.246
Don't worry about that.
I'll take care of everything.

40:15.329 --> 40:17.998
How can I not worry?
You said someone died!

40:19.083 --> 40:20.918
This is exactly what the reporters want.

40:21.001 --> 40:22.002
Yeon-jin.

40:22.628 --> 40:23.796
I told you this before.

40:23.879 --> 40:25.673
Everyone makes mistakes.

40:25.756 --> 40:29.301
But you never find a solution in the past.
It's always in front of you.

40:29.802 --> 40:31.429
Someone died. That was yesterday.

40:31.512 --> 40:33.848
Today, we'll do what we need to do.

40:34.432 --> 40:35.599
What are you saying?

40:48.696 --> 40:52.116
If that man has the original file,

40:52.825 --> 40:54.326
you should make a decision soon.

40:56.328 --> 41:00.332
If he leaks it first,
it will be very bad for us.

41:06.547 --> 41:09.717
Find a town in the UK or Ireland
where Ye-sol could go.

41:11.218 --> 41:12.803
A guardian will accompany her.

41:17.725 --> 41:18.976
It's snowing heavily.

41:23.481 --> 41:24.315
Be careful.

41:25.357 --> 41:27.443
Yes, sir. You too.

42:03.646 --> 42:05.814
KIM JIN-HUN
WE HAVE A DATE FOR YOUR INTERVIEW

42:37.638 --> 42:38.556
Where's the shaman?

42:39.056 --> 42:41.809
She's preparing for a special ritual
that is coming up.

43:02.830 --> 43:03.664
Hello?

43:04.373 --> 43:06.458
I'm not sure if I should tell you this.

43:06.542 --> 43:08.377
It's about Kang Hyeon-nam's husband.

43:09.044 --> 43:10.546
That bastard died yesterday.

43:11.088 --> 43:13.090
He got hit by a car while jaywalking.

43:26.604 --> 43:28.022
Is this your husband?

43:32.776 --> 43:33.611
Are you okay?

43:34.486 --> 43:35.404
I'm okay.

43:37.364 --> 43:38.240
That is

43:39.783 --> 43:40.659
my husband.

44:50.229 --> 44:51.230
Yeon-jin!

44:52.147 --> 44:54.817
It's been a while. How have you been?

44:57.152 --> 44:59.488
Yeon-jin. It's me, So-hee.

44:59.988 --> 45:02.866
The girl that moved schools.
Do you remember me?

45:03.575 --> 45:05.661
What are you doing right now?

45:06.787 --> 45:08.789
Should I strip out of these clothes?

45:09.748 --> 45:12.251
Do you want me to take these clothes off

45:13.210 --> 45:14.378
and give them to you?

45:15.087 --> 45:16.088
What is this?

45:17.673 --> 45:18.924
What's this bullshit?

45:33.897 --> 45:35.566
Then strip. It's not too late.

45:36.734 --> 45:39.153
Yeon-jin, please.
These aren't even the same clothes.

45:39.236 --> 45:40.821
I don't care what you're wearing.

45:40.904 --> 45:45.117
Why do the likes of you not listen
when I ask nicely?

45:52.207 --> 45:55.043
Are you wearing a sweater or lint?

45:56.044 --> 45:57.171
One minute.

45:58.255 --> 45:59.256
My patience...

46:09.725 --> 46:10.559
I said, strip.

46:11.518 --> 46:12.853
That's enough.

46:16.273 --> 46:18.066
I'm not scared of you anymore.

46:21.236 --> 46:23.155
You're nothing by yourself.

46:26.033 --> 46:27.534
What the fuck are you saying?

46:27.618 --> 46:28.952
Did you watch a teen movie?

46:29.036 --> 46:31.038
I was only scared of your money.

46:32.956 --> 46:34.708
I pity you, actually.

46:37.127 --> 46:39.213
So I'm going to forgive you.

46:40.506 --> 46:42.841
Because I'm a better person than you are.

46:45.969 --> 46:46.804
Wow.

46:48.889 --> 46:51.058
You just made me a pitiful bitch

46:52.059 --> 46:54.311
who is worse than you are.

46:54.394 --> 46:57.397
Fuck, that's a lot to take in at once.

47:00.025 --> 47:01.193
Is that right?

47:01.777 --> 47:06.240
Then can you allow this pitiful bitch
to remove the lint on your sweater?

47:10.410 --> 47:12.037
You said you're the better person.

47:13.247 --> 47:14.581
So you should dress properly.

47:15.707 --> 47:17.209
What are you doing?

47:17.292 --> 47:18.877
If you move,

47:20.003 --> 47:21.505
I'll go to your school tomorrow.

47:30.472 --> 47:33.308
Go on. Try running your mouth now.

47:35.811 --> 47:36.937
Help!

47:39.565 --> 47:40.858
Go away!

47:44.903 --> 47:46.446
SCHOOL WITHDRAWAL FORM

48:32.826 --> 48:33.660
Mom.

48:34.661 --> 48:35.829
Mom, what do I do?

48:36.330 --> 48:37.331
What do I do, Mom?

48:37.414 --> 48:39.917
Seriously, what am I going to do with you?

48:40.500 --> 48:42.920
-Why did you skip your lessons again?
-Mom!

48:43.003 --> 48:44.588
I think I messed up!

48:46.340 --> 48:49.718
We were just fooling around on the roof,
and she got caught on fire.

48:52.095 --> 48:53.513
The girl who moved schools.

48:55.098 --> 48:57.559
She was struggling by herself,
and then she fell.

48:58.060 --> 48:59.353
It's true!

49:01.146 --> 49:03.148
It was just the two of us!

49:05.609 --> 49:06.443
Mom.

49:08.278 --> 49:10.864
Mom, what do I do? Huh?

49:10.948 --> 49:11.782
Hello?

49:14.242 --> 49:15.160
Hello? Mom?

49:15.243 --> 49:16.745
Get a grip, Yeon-jin!

49:16.828 --> 49:18.080
First, get away from there.

49:18.705 --> 49:20.374
Mr. Shin will be calling you soon.

49:20.457 --> 49:22.209
Stop crying and talk properly!

49:22.292 --> 49:24.461
Any witnesses? Did anyone see you?

49:24.544 --> 49:25.379
No.

49:26.380 --> 49:28.799
-I don't think so.
-Make sure! Look around you.

49:28.882 --> 49:31.134
There is no one. I'm sure!

49:37.599 --> 49:38.558
EVIDENCE

49:41.311 --> 49:43.647
They didn't do a DNA test at the time.

49:44.731 --> 49:47.651
The report says
the lighter was used by the deceased…

